<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">V3LMA: Visual 3D-enhanced Language Model for Autonomous Driving</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jannik Lübberstedt<span id="id1" class="ltx_text"> </span>
